	TAD I DTAPE
	ISZ DTAPE
	DCA DCORE	/FIRST CORE LOCATION-1 OF TRANSFER
	TAD I DTAPE
	AND Z70
	DCA DTFLD	/SAVE FIELD TO BE READ INTO
	TAD I DTAPE
	AND D7600	/GET LENGTH IN PAGES
	ISZ DTAPE
	DCA DWDS	/ -NUMBER OF WORDS TO BE TRANSFERRED
	TAD I DTAPE	/GET BLOCK NO.
	ISZ DTAPE
	DCA DTEM	/AND STORE
	TAD DTSF1
	DCA DTINTR+2	/PUT DTSF IN SKIP CHAIN

	/INITIATE SEARCH

