	DTLA		/LOAD STATUS A
	TAD Z10		/DTBLOCK IS IN FIELD 1
	DTLB
	JMP I DDTDIS	/PUT HIM TO SLEEP FOR A WHILE

DTEM,	0

/CHECK THE LIST OF ERRORS CAREFULLY SO THIS DOESN'T CONFLICT
/WITH ERRORS IN FIELD 0.
