	TAD K32		/READ NORMAL, CANCEL SEARCH (20+10)
	DTXA		/SET FUNCTION
	TAD DCORE	/1ST CORE LOC.-1 OF TRANSFER
	CDF
	DCA I DCAA	/TO 7755(CA)
	TAD DTFLD	/FIELD OF BUFFER
	DTLB		/TO DECTAPE REGISTER B
	ISZ MCOM	/POINT INTERRUPT RETURN TO DATA
