CTLCOK,	TAD I XPC	/PATCHED OVER
	JMP CTRLEX
CTRLCY,	IAC		/SET FLAG TO NO CTRLC
	DCA CTRLCFLG
	TAD AERR4	/IN KEY (IT'S OK CAUSE HE IS RUNNING
