/ THIS ROUTINE TESTS IF TTY INPUT IS COMING IN FOR
/THE CDR USER.
CDRSUP,	0
	TAD I [DECK	/GET THE USER NO. FOR THIS INPUT.
	CIA
	CDF 10
	TAD I YCRUNO	/IS IT THE SAME AS THE CDR USER?
	CIF CDF
	SNA CLA
	JMP I YSUPPR	/YES, DON'T USE THE INPUT.
	TAD I YLSMOD	/NO, IS LISTING SUPPRESSED?
	SZA
	ISZ CDRSUP	/NO.
	JMP I CDRSUP
YCRUNO,	CRUNO
YSUPPR,	SUPRET
YLSMOD,	LSTMOD
