/THE ENTRIES IN THIS TABLE ARE AS FOLLOWS:
/LABELS INDICATE NUMBER OF FIELDS AND NUMBER OF USERS.
/	E.G. THE ENTRIES AT BGL32 ARE USED TO ALLOCATE
/		A 2 USER SYSTEM IN A 16 K (HIGHEST FIELD=3)
/		MACHINE.
