/	USER NUMBER MINUS ONE
/	USER FIELD
/	NUMBER OF BLOCKS MINUS ONE FOR THIS USER
/E.G. THE ENTRIES AT BGL32 ARE:
/	BGL32,	03^X+17
/		12^X+15
